  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MsgrY7H.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"746\"></p><p><strong>重铸末影灾变</strong>是一款连接<strong>圣遗物</strong>与<strong>末影灾变</strong>模组的扩展包，带来了一系列以末影灾变中恐怖首领和机制为主题的强力圣遗物。每件圣遗物都凝聚了其来源的精髓，赋予玩家源自史诗战斗的独特能力，并通过富有挑战性的新内容来丰富游戏后期体验。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A9smNTN.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"614\" height=\"100\"></p><p>必要前置模组：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">圣遗物模组</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">末影灾变</a></li>\n</ul><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yTXVV3R.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"473\" height=\"100\"></p><ul>\n<li><strong>1.21.1版本：</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliquified-l-ender-s-cataclysm/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.21.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NEOFORGE</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QX7xIfs.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"193\" height=\"100\"></p><p><strong>问：能否将本模组加入整合包？</strong><br>答：可以自由使用。</p><p><strong>问：能否转载本模组？</strong><br>答：禁止二次发布。</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TgsjGyN.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gG6f4t0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Octo-Studios/reliquified-lenders-cataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sK6KJcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252freliquified-l-ender-s-cataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OYN08d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fPIlVls.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想体验我们其他作品？访问<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252focto-studios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">章鱼工作室官网</a></span>获取更多信息！</strong></p>\n</div>",
